('tt0347149', 'Howl\'s Moving Castle', 2004, 'PG', '2004-11-20', 119, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Diana Wynne Jones', 'Chieko Baishô, Takuya Kimura, Tatsuya Gashûin', 'When an unconfident young woman is cursed with an old body by a spiteful witch, her only chance of breaking the spell lies with a self-indulgent yet insecure young wizard and his companions in his legged, walking castle.', 'Japanese', 'Japan', 'Nominated for 1 Oscar. 15 wins & 21 nominations total', 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMTY1OTg0MjE3MV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNTUxMTkyMQ@@._V1_QL75_UX380_CR0,0,380,562_.jpg', NULL, 82, 8.2, 463000, 'movie', NULL, 5576743, NULL, NULL, 5),
